  "description": "At 29, Eun-Seong is told she’ll die by autumn. She skips chemo, quits her job, leaves her mother’s house, and dyes her hair for the first time in her life. Then, on a whim, she adds one last thing: a night with a stranger who prefers no-strings-attached encounters. She decides to stay with him until autumn—when her time runs out.\n\n(Source: Manta)",
